<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Support - East Village Everything</title>
  <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/foundation/5.5.3/css/foundation.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/css/main.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="row header text-center">
    <div class="columns small-12">
      <h1><a class="site-title" href="/">East Village Everything</a></h1>
      <h2>Support</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row main-content page">
    <div class="columns small-12 large-8 large-centered">
      <h3>About the app</h3>
      <p>East Village Everything is a guide to the bars and late-night spots of the East Village, Manhattan. It lists more than 350 places with their hours, address, phone number, website and tags, so you can find the happy hour that is still going, the bar with a pool table or a dart board, trivia tonight, or what is open late. Tap the bookmark on any place to keep it in your Saved list. There is nothing to sign up for, and the app never asks for your location.</p>

      <h3>Get in touch</h3>
      <p>Found a mistake, a place that has closed, or a spot that should be in the app? Having trouble with the app itself? Email <a href="mailto:<%= contactEmail %>"><%= contactEmail %></a>. Include the name of the place or, for app problems, your iPhone model and iOS version.</p>

      <p>How the app handles data is described in the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>

      <p class="back"><a href="/">Back to East Village Everything</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
